### Check queue status
GET https://localhost:7031/api/queue/status

### Process next message
POST https://localhost:7031/api/queue/process-next

### View processed messages
GET https://localhost:7031/api/queue/processed


### Find latest reading for a device
GET https://localhost:7031/api/queue/devices/ESP32-0001

### View latest readings for all devices
GET https://localhost:7031/api/queue/devices

### View timestamp-sorted telemetry history
GET https://localhost:7031/api/queue/history






### View active alerts
GET https://localhost:7031/api/alerts/active

